The fix has three parts. The node no longer traps when `urls` is missing, since a trap is not a valid output. It now returns an empty list instead. It also adds the platform-approved `http-client` import and enrichment fetch, and its output is unchanged. `RunInfo` has no text field, so the enrichment query uses `date`, percent-encoded.

```wit
